description = Color([PAWN_nameDef] was born to low-ranked servants on an ancient starship. The ship's machine persona was like a third parent to [PAWN_objective], and the parts crafting crew [PAWN_pronoun] worked for was like a second family.
\n[PAWN_nameDef] rarely saw plants or animals, and still finds them unnerving to touch., 1.0)
